#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/03-testing.md:5
#: 1699dd4f7f064f0cbbe304647b205640
msgid ""
"How this tree is validated: C unit binaries under `tests/unit/`, per-"
"module Autotools `TESTS` collected by `make print_tests`, ESL `make "
"check`, clang `scan-build`, then a short live-process smoke after `make "
"install`. GitHub Actions is the source of truth for the automated path "
"(`.github/workflows/ci.yml`). There is no published coverage percentage "
"in this repo."
msgstr ""
"本仓库如何验证：`tests/unit/` 下的 C 单元二进制、由 `make print_tests` 收集的各模块 Autotools "
"`TESTS`、ESL `make check`、clang `scan-build`，以及 `make install` "
"之后的短时在线冒烟。自动化路径的权威来源是 GitHub "
"Actions（`.github/workflows/ci.yml`）。本仓库没有公布覆盖率百分比。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/03-testing.md:7
#: 0538e713c8d64154b28283a66e945a76
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"New core tests must use `src/include/test/switch_test.h` "
"(`tests/unit/README`). Do not use GoogleTest, Catch2, or a tree-wide C++ "
"harness. Do not use `scripts/debian_min_build.sh` as a test or build "
"environment (Jessie / FreeSWITCH 1.6 pins; see [Quick Start](../0"
".getting-started/02-quick-start.md))."
msgstr ""
"新的核心测试必须使用 `src/include/test/switch_test.h`（`tests/unit/README`）。不要把 "
"`scripts/debian_min_build.sh` 当作测试或构建环境（钉死 Jessie / FreeSWITCH 1.6；见 "
"[快速开始](01-quick-start.md)）。"

