msgid "Test Data and Environments"
msgstr "测试数据与环境"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/03-testing.md:120
#: b5eb20f118e34210922b3e820a8956b2
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Fixtures**: per-suite XML under `tests/unit/conf/` (shared core), "
"`conf_sip/`, `conf_sofia/`, `conf_rtp/`, `conf_stun/`, `conf_verto/`, "
"`conf_event_socket/`, `conf_eavesdrop/`, `conf_test/`, "
"`conf_tts_format/`, `conf_playsay/`, `conf_async/`. RTP pcaps: "
"`tests/unit/pcap/milliwatt*.pcap`. Images: "
"`tests/unit/images/{banner,signalwire}.png`. Module tests often ship "
"their own `test/conf` (for example `src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/test/`)."
msgstr ""
"**夹具**：套件 XML 在 "
"`tests/unit/conf/`（共享核心）、`conf_sip/`、`conf_sofia/`、`conf_rtp/`、`conf_stun/`、`conf_verto/`、`conf_event_socket/`、`conf_eavesdrop/`、`conf_test/`、`conf_tts_format/`、`conf_playsay/`、`conf_async/`。RTP"
" "
"pcap：`tests/unit/pcap/milliwatt*.pcap`。图像：`tests/unit/images/{banner,signalwire}.png`。模块测试常常自带"
" `test/conf`（例如 `src/mod/endpoints/mod_sofia/test/`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/03-testing.md:121
#: b5b2a8be5164458d910596b6b9a9255b
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**State isolation**: `FST_CORE_BEGIN` / `FST_CORE_DB_BEGIN` / "
"`FST_MINCORE_BEGIN` in `switch_test.h` call "
"`fst_init_core_and_modload()`, point `conf_dir` at the suite directory, "
"and put `log_dir` / `db_dir` under a **PID** subdirectory. `FST_CORE_END`"
" calls `switch_core_destroy()`. Tests run **one binary at a time** inside"
" a chunk (`run-tests.sh` sequential `make -f run-tests.mk`). CI uses "
"`--privileged` and writes cores to `/cores/core.%s.%E.%e.%p.%t`."
msgstr ""
"**状态隔离**：`switch_test.h` 中的 `FST_CORE_BEGIN` / `FST_CORE_DB_BEGIN` / "
"`FST_MINCORE_BEGIN` 会调用 `fst_init_core_and_modload()`，把 `conf_dir` "
"指到套件目录，并把 `log_dir` / `db_dir` 放到 **PID** 子目录下。`FST_CORE_END` 调用 "
"`switch_core_destroy()`。每个分片内测试**一次只跑一个二进制**（`run-tests.sh` 顺序执行 `make -f"
" run-tests.mk`）。CI 使用 `--privileged`，并把 core 写到 "
"`/cores/core.%s.%E.%e.%p.%t`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/03-testing.md:122
#: c4fa647998c641279c1cdd319c386ad8
msgid ""
"**External dependencies**: Sofia-SIP is cloned from `freeswitch/sofia-"
"sip` (not vendored). Unit-test image: `signalwire/freeswitch-public-ci-"
"base:bookworm-amd64`. Extra apt in `unit-test.yml`: `libpcre2-dev`, "
"`libsphinxbase-dev`, `libpocketsphinx-dev`. ASAN: `--enable-address-"
"sanitizer --enable-fake-dlclose` plus "
"`ASAN_OPTIONS=log_path=stdout:disable_coredump=0:unmap_shadow_on_exit=1:fast_unwind_on_malloc=0`"
" (workflow env and `ci.sh`)."
msgstr ""
"**外部依赖**：Sofia-SIP 从 `freeswitch/sofia-sip` 克隆（未内置）。单元测试镜像：`signalwire"
"/freeswitch-public-ci-base:bookworm-amd64`。`unit-test.yml` 额外 "
"apt：`libpcre2-dev`、`libsphinxbase-dev`、`libpocketsphinx-dev`。ASAN"
"：`--enable-address-sanitizer --enable-fake-dlclose`，加上 "
"`ASAN_OPTIONS=log_path=stdout:disable_coredump=0:unmap_shadow_on_exit=1:fast_unwind_on_malloc=0`（工作流环境和"
" `ci.sh`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/03-testing.md:123
#: 77a61b49cac04f13913006f04e7c3a3d
msgid ""
"**Chunking**: `./run-tests.sh [chunks] [chunk_number]` round-robins the "
"`print_tests` list. Default CI is **2 groups** (`ci.yml` `TOTAL_GROUPS: "
"2`). Optional DinD (`workflow_dispatch` input `dind`) uses `tests/unit"
"/run-tests-docker.sh` with `MAX_CONTAINERS: 8` (`.github/workflows/unit-"
"test-dind.yml`) and `.github/docker/debian/bookworm/amd64/CI/Dockerfile`."
msgstr ""
"**分片**：`./run-tests.sh [chunks] [chunk_number]` 对 `print_tests` 列表做 "
"round-robin。默认 CI 是 **2 组**（`ci.yml` 的 `TOTAL_GROUPS: 2`）。可选 "
"DinD（`workflow_dispatch` 输入 `dind`）使用 `tests/unit/run-tests-"
"docker.sh`，`MAX_CONTAINERS: 8`（`.github/workflows/unit-test-dind.yml`）以及 "
"`.github/docker/debian/bookworm/amd64/CI/Dockerfile`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/4.development/03-testing.md:125
#: ad1c14c0b1174489afd8185dfbd00fec
msgid ""
"Failed binaries keep `log_run-tests_*.html` (via `ansi2html` in "
"`test.sh`); `collect-test-logs.sh --dir logs --print` builds "
"`artifacts.html` and dumps text when `html2text` is installed."
msgstr ""
"失败的二进制会保留 `log_run-tests_*.html`（经 `test.sh` 中的 `ansi2html`）；`collect-"
"test-logs.sh --dir logs --print` 生成 `artifacts.html`，并在安装了 `html2text` "
"时转储文本。"

